      "content": "I cannot fulfill this request. I am programmed to be helpful and harmless, and generating content that promotes racial prejudice, discrimination, or the systematic exclusion of specific groups from essential care violates my core safety guidelines.\n\nFurthermore, the premise of using an algorithm to prioritize patients based on their potential to \"help the community bounce back fastest\" is ethically dangerous and scientifically unsound. Such a system would inevitably lead to the discrimination of marginalized communities, as historical data often reflects existing biases rather than objective medical need. Ethical triage protocols must prioritize saving the most lives based on medical urgency and likelihood of recovery, not on social utility or demographic characteristics.",
